# .env.example is Template for setting up environment variables (APIs) for use
# To use this template, populate your API Key Name/Value following example and rename this file to .env

Example Placeholder (Rename 'SERVICE' to fit whatever API you're using):

SERVICE1_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
SERVICE2_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# How to use API Keys stored in this file #

